    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/50a9d476ac2e4390813df233eb6710ed","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/50a9d476ac2e4390813df233eb6710ed","content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eFrom mines and quarries to windfarms and solar parks, our presence in the NC remains strong.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/wqhhccnx/1920-northern-cape-mining.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003eThe Northern Cape is home to 75% of the world\u0027s manganese deposits.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"\u003eAlong with some impressive iron ore and diamond operations, mining and quarrying contributes 18% to the local economy. That\u0027s more than double the national average of 7%.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver the past 5 years the various mining companies which operate in the Northern Cape have invested more than R700m in development projects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHere are some of the award-winning projects we\u0027ve been a part of in the Northern Cape .\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/qr3nobgj/kaxu-solar-one-project.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eRoadlab\u0027s Upington branch conducted geotechnical investigations for Kaxu Solar One in 2015, ensuring the load-bearing capacity of the soil. This also allowed the engineers to evaluate and assure the integrity of the concrete bases on which all the individual panels would rest. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>From new projects and business developments to safety and accreditation news, here's the latest from Roadlab.</p>]]></Value>
